OL,3,AJudgement day for Kenya pastor accused
OL,4,Aof ordering parents to starve their
OL,5,Achildren to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Kenyan court is set to deliver a
OL,8,Fjudgement in a mass murder case
OL,9,Finvolving doomsday preacher Paul
OL,10,FMackenzie.
OL,12,FMackenzie and 29 of his followers are
OL,13,Fbeing charged with the murder of 191
OL,14,Fpeople, all but one of them children.
OL,16,FHis cult is alleged to have forced
OL,17,Fchildren to starve to death so that
OL,18,Fthey could "meet Jesus". His doomsday
OL,19,Fdoctrine said that education was
OL,20,Fforbidden and modern medicine was
OL,21,Fconsidered "evil".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
